<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Welcome to POS Inventory System</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        padding: 20px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #0056b3);
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: white;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 28px;
      }
      .header p {
        margin: 10px 0 0 0;
        font-size: 16px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
      .welcome-box {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .info-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .info-card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #007bff;
        font-size: 18px;
      }
      .info-card p {
        margin: 5px 0;
        color: #666;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .user-details {
        background: #f0f8ff;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .user-details p {
        margin: 8px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .user-details strong {
        color: #007bff;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #007bff;
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 30px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        background: #0056b3;
      }
      .features {
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .feature-item {
        padding: 10px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      }
      .feature-item:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }
      .feature-item span {
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-right: 10px;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .support-info {
        background: #fff3cd;
        border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>🎉 Welcome to POS Inventory!</h1>
        <p>Your account has been successfully created</p>
      </div>

      <div class="welcome-box">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #007bff;">Hello <%= name %>! 👋</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          Thank you for joining <strong>POS Inventory System</strong>. We're excited to have you on board! 
          Your account has been created successfully and you're all set to get started.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="user-details">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333;">📋 Your Account Details</h3>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <%= email %></p>
        <p><strong>Role:</strong> <%= role %></p>
        <p><strong>Registration Date:</strong> <%= registrationDate %></p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>🚀 Getting Started</h3>
        <p>
          You can now log in to your account using your email and password. 
          For enhanced security, we use OTP (One-Time Password) verification for each login.
        </p>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
          <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="cta-button">Login to Your Account</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="features">
        <h3 style="color: #333; margin-bottom: 15px;">✨ What You Can Do</h3>
        
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span>📦</span>
          <strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Track and manage your inventory in real-time
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span>💰</span>
          <strong>Sales Processing:</strong> Process transactions quickly and efficiently
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span>📊</span>
          <strong>Reports & Analytics:</strong> Get insights into your business performance
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span>🔐</span>
          <strong>Secure Access:</strong> Your data is protected with advanced security features
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="support-info">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #856404;">💡 Need Help?</h3>
        <p style="margin: 5px 0; color: #856404; font-size: 14px;">
          If you have any questions or need assistance getting started, our support team is here to help. 
          Don't hesitate to reach out!
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>🔒 Security Tips</h3>
        <ul style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li>Never share your password or OTP codes with anyone</li>
          <li>Enable all available security features for your account</li>
          <li>Log out when using shared devices</li>
          <li>Contact support immediately if you notice any suspicious activity</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333; margin: 0;">
          <strong>Thank you for choosing POS Inventory System!</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 10px 0 0 0;">
          We're committed to helping your business grow and succeed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 POS Inventory System. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 10px;">
          This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.
        </p>
        <p style="color: #aaa; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 5px;">
          If you did not create this account, please contact our support team immediately.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
